<p class="dialog-lead">
	During belt examinations, you have the opportunity to demonstrate the knowledge and
	skills you have acquired. Initially, these evaluations take place within the club;
	however, as you advance, examinations for brown and black belts are conducted directly
	before the Federation's board.
